See Around you, the internet is filled with millions of "web pages"

This web pages are made up to standard markup language HTML.
HTML => Hyper Text markup language 

Using the HTML we can create web sites however we want 

HTML consists of a series of elements that tells the browser how to display the content.


Basically the web browser will read the html documents and display them correctly.

for Ex: content inside the <title> </title> tag

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <title>My Web Page</title>
    </head>
    <body>
        <h1> Welcome to my web page</h1>>
    </body>
</html>

Here the browser will understand that it is the title of the web page and will display it in the title bar of the browser window.

similary the content inside the <h1> </h1> tag will be displayed as a heading on the web page.
[ Browser understanding ]

similarly using HTML we can display the images, tables, forms etc on the web page.

Building a web site using is HTML is easy and simple, use the steps below.
=> understand the different HTML tags, elements such as 
<h1> => heading
<p>  => paragraph
<title> => title of the web page.
<img> => image
<table> => table
<form> => forms 

NOTE: Using the above HTML elements markup and design your own document and save it with .html extension.
Afer all this open the document in any web browser and see the output.

NOTE: Open the file using the web browser and then we can see the web site.